```rego
package authz

import future.keywords.if

# input: { subject: { user_id, org_id, team_ids }, action, resource: { type, id, org_id }, perms }

allow if { deny == false; has_perm }

deny if { input.resource.type == project"; 
          resource_acl_deny[input.resource.id][input.subject] }

has_perm if {
  some p; p == input.action;
  resolved_perms[input.subject][input.resource] [p] == true
}
```
Resolve `resolved_perms` server-side from grants and role_permissions; resource_acl_deny is a materialized map of explicit denies."

